Version 1.1

Copyright (c) nakashunsan. All rights reserved.

This license applies to the original character "Aurora" and the files made
available in this repository.

1. Definitions

"Character" means the original character Aurora and its character design.

"Repository Assets" means image files and other materials in this repository
for which nakashunsan holds the rights necessary to grant this license.

"Model Data" means any VRoid, VRM, 3D model, source model, texture, rig, or
similar data used to create or represent the Character, whether or not it is
included in this repository.

"Third-Party Works" means illustrations and other works created by a person
other than nakashunsan.

2. Creating new works depicting Aurora

You may create and publish your own original illustrations and other original
works depicting the Character without obtaining prior permission from
nakashunsan. Personal and commercial use is permitted, provided that you comply
with this license.

This permission applies to newly created works depicting the Character. It does
not permit copying, tracing, editing, compositing, or otherwise making a
derivative work from a particular Repository Asset or Third-Party Work.

3. Use of Repository Assets and permission for derivative works

You may download and view the Repository Assets and use them as references for
creating a new original work under Section 2.

Except for the AI uses expressly permitted in Section 6, prior permission from
nakashunsan is required to copy, trace, edit, composite, animate, distribute, or
otherwise use a Repository Asset to create or publish a derivative work. Prior
permission is also required to sell, sublicense, or redistribute a Repository
Asset, including a file that is substantially identical to it, as an asset
collection or standalone download.

4. Model Data is reserved for nakashunsan

Use of the Model Data is exclusively reserved for nakashunsan. No other person
may use, operate, copy, modify, convert, upload, distribute, or make available
any Model Data without nakashunsan's prior permission. Possession of, or access
to, Model Data does not grant any license to use it.

5. Rights in works created by other creators

An original illustration or other work depicting the Character that is created
by another creator remains subject to that creator's copyright and chosen
license. This license does not replace, override, or automatically grant rights
under that creator's license. Rights in the underlying Character remain with
nakashunsan.

You must obtain permission from the applicable creator before copying, editing,
training on, or otherwise using their work unless their license or applicable
law expressly permits that use.

6. Artificial intelligence

Repository Assets created by nakashunsan may be used as inputs for artificial
intelligence systems, including for machine-learning training, fine-tuning, and
AI-assisted image generation. AI-generated output may be created and published,
subject to the other terms of this license and applicable law.

Third-Party Works may not be used for machine-learning training, fine-tuning,
dataset creation, prompts using an uploaded or linked copy of the work, or other
AI-assisted generation unless the relevant creator separately and expressly
permits that use. This prohibition applies even if a Third-Party Work is stored
or displayed in this repository.

7. Attribution

When you publish or distribute a work under this license, please provide the
following credit in a location reasonably visible to its audience:

