Equivalent wording or a link to this repository is acceptable if it clearly
identifies the Character and rights holder. If credit is technically or
physically impracticable, include it in related documentation, product pages,
descriptions, or credits where reasonably possible.

8. General restrictions

You may not:

a. claim that you created or own the Character or the original Repository
   Assets;
b. imply that your work, product, or activity is official, sponsored, approved,
